  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/pyjs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. inherited_calls.py _linearize_c3/_walk_c3 unchanged in shape @100b6fbb6e (4 later commits touch other walkers/docs). Fixture fx_pituk: A(B), B(A), Base(A) defines helper, MyTests(Base) in another file calls self.helper(): the call stays external:helper with no superseded_by, no meta, and the inherited-calls-linker AnalysisRun has no refusal field; control MyTests2(Base2(Plain)) resolves self.helper2() to Plain.helper2. Both halves (prefix over-refusal, silent refusal) reproduce. MECHANISM: _linearize_c3 returns None on any cycle reached through ancestry and _walk_c3 refuses, with no meta/counter recording the refusal. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-vipir."  # 1e34
